        "subject": "LU-20924 ldiskfs: hybrid patch for Ubuntu26.04 7.0.0-40 kernel",
        "message": "LU-20924 ldiskfs: hybrid patch for Ubuntu26.04 7.0.0-40 kernel\n\nAdd ext4-mballoc-for-hybrid.patch to the ubuntu26 7.0.0-40 series,\nwhich is used for current Ubuntu 26.04 kernels.  It differs from the\n7.0.0-14 series only in two ubuntu26.04 patches that do not touch the\nfiles changed by the hybrid patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I53077c5a10a6302913ef37e54e47981d3d4da615\n"
